{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0069-s001", "text": "I de lägre årskurserna är skoldagarna kortare än i de högre.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T022102272981+0000-2/hb-c08-u0069-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.572789115646258, "peak": 0.2655029296875, "generation_seconds": 13.863066802034155, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0069-s002", "text": "I årskurserna 1–6 får eleverna 20–25 timmar undervisning i veckan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T022102272981+0000-2/hb-c08-u0069-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.9412244897959186, "peak": 0.245330810546875, "generation_seconds": 21.85611806390807, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0069-s003", "text": "I årskurserna 7–9 är timantalet per vecka i genomsnitt 29–30 timmar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T022102272981+0000-2/hb-c08-u0069-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.568163265306122, "peak": 0.34832763671875, "generation_seconds": 18.63610261119902, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0069-s004", "text": "Mellan lektionerna tar man pauser, det vill säga raster.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T022102272981+0000-2/hb-c08-u0069-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.154829931972789, "peak": 0.37811279296875, "generation_seconds": 13.463003320153803, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0069-s005", "text": "En lektion är i allmänhet 45 minuter lång.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T022102272981+0000-2/hb-c08-u0069-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.806530612244898, "peak": 0.286865234375, "generation_seconds": 12.045465321047232, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0069-s006", "text": "Mellan lektionerna har man 15–30 minuter långa raster, som eleverna tillbringar på skolan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T022102272981+0000-2/hb-c08-u0069-s006.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.846802721088435, "peak": 0.453094482421875, "generation_seconds": 22.97146938391961, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0070-s001", "text": "I skolan får eleverna elevhandledning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T022102272981+0000-2/hb-c08-u0070-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.5526530612244898, "peak": 0.250762939453125, "generation_seconds": 10.344253422925249, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0070-s002", "text": "Inom handledningen får eleven stöd för studierna och försöker man förebygga att problem uppstår i dem.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T022102272981+0000-2/hb-c08-u0070-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.6378231292517, "peak": 0.277587890625, "generation_seconds": 21.558315915986896, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
